   "title": "Hand, joint, bone or diabetic foot: HOW DEEP is it, and does it need a knife as well as antibiotics?",
   "lines": [
    "antibiotics alone will NOT save you: pus in a closed space, a joint or dead bone needs drainage or debridement",
    "one hot joint with Staphylococcus or streptococcus: see the ACUTE MONOARTHRITIS chart"
   ]
  },
